            The best pellet stove is the one sized honestly for the rooms you need warm, with a hopper big enough for your routine and an install that follows the manual, the permit and the clearances. For most homes, that is the ComfortBilt HP22. For fewer refills, the PelPro PP150. For a smaller space, the Castle Serenity.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
